        "Good! Hold this drum.",
        "The big one or the small one?",
        "The small one. Listen: bum, bum, ka-bum.",
        "Bum, bum, ka-bum! It’s great fun!",
        "The children who dance will dance Bakisimba.",
        "And who will sing?",
